// Multifactor Authentication Interrupted | T1078.004, T1110, T1621 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/cloud/azure/signin_logs/azure_mfa_interrupted.yml
any where (ResultType:50074 and ResultDescription:"*Strong Auth required*") or (ResultType:500121 and ResultDescription:"*Authentication failed during strong authentication request*")
